\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Pentagon logic in the notation of Sec.~\ref {sec:odd-cycles}. The cyclic atoms \(a_1,\ldots  ,a_5\) are intertwining atoms, each shared by two adjacent contexts. The atoms \(x_1,\ldots  ,x_5\) are context-specific. Each colored broken line represents one context \(C_i=\{a_i,a_{i+1},x_i\}\), with indices understood modulo~\(5\).}}{8}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
